WEBVTT

00:03:57.534 --> 00:04:00.370
that continue to circulate
in American society

00:04:00.403 --> 00:04:03.740
on sheet music, magazines, books,

00:04:03.774 --> 00:04:07.277
vaudeville, theater, film, television,

00:04:07.310 --> 00:04:09.780
radio, records

00:04:09.813 --> 00:04:11.648
and all kinds of formats.

00:04:12.215 --> 00:04:15.018
These stereotypes
were a powerful reinforcement

00:04:15.051 --> 00:04:18.622
of the ideas of white supremacy
and Black inferiority.

00:04:19.923 --> 00:04:22.058
The news headlines of the last few months

00:04:22.092 --> 00:04:24.995
have shown us that the legacy
of blackface minstrelsy

00:04:24.995 --> 00:04:26.696
continues to haunt us.

00:04:27.164 --> 00:04:30.233
